&lt;p&gt;This was an app I made with a duo partner for the subject &amp;ldquo;Mobile Development - Android&amp;rdquo;. It features a library of cocktails and their recipes, these are retrieved via the &lt;a href="https://www.thecocktaildb.com/api.php"&gt;TheCocktailDB API&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="technologies-used-"&gt;Technologies Used 🛠️&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Android Studio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kotlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jetpack Compose&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hilt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ktor (API calls)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coil (image loading)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coroutines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
